00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:48.460
<i>Aozora ni kazashita te</i>

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:48.460
I held my hands up to the blue sky

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:48.460
青空に かざした手

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:55.610
<i>Sukima kara kao wo dasu natsugumo</i>

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:55.610
Between my fingers, I saw the clouds of summer

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:55.610
隙間から顔を出す 夏雲

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:10.480
<i>Ushiro kara kimi ga yobu</i>

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:10.480
You called to me from behind

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:10.480
後ろから 君が呼ぶ

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:17.900
<i>Itsumoyori mujaki na egao de boku wo miru</i>

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:17.900
And looked at me with a smile more innocent than usual

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:17.900
いつもより無邪気な笑顔で 僕を見る

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:21.590
<i>Are kara dorekurai no</i>

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:21.590
How much time has passed since then?

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:21.590
あれからどれくらいの

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:25.200
<i>Toki ga tachikizutsuite kita darou</i>

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:25.200
How much pain has its passing inflicted?

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:25.200
時が経ち傷ついてきただろう

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:31.730
<i>Soredemo bokutachi wa arukitsuzukeru no</i>

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:31.730
Nevertheless, we keep on walking

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:31.730
それでも僕たちは 歩き続けるの

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:35.960
<i>Sagashitsuzukeru no</i>

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:35.960
We keep on searching

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:35.960
探し続けるの

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:43.090
<i>Hadashi de kakenukete futari de waraiatta</i>

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:43.090
We ran barefoot and laughed together

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:43.090
裸足で駆け抜けて ふたりで笑いあった

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.610
<i>Chotto dake furimuite</i>

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.610
If I look back just for a bit

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.610
ちょっとだけ振り向いて

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.370
<i>Tooi kioku ni egaita mirai</i>

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.370
I see the future depicted in my distant memories

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.370
遠い記憶に描いた未来

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:57.640
<i>Boku no me ni utsuru mono kimi no me ni utsuru mono</i>

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:57.640
The things you see and the things I see

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:57.640
僕の目に映るもの 君の眼に映るもの

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.990
<i>Kitto sore wa hitotsu da yo to</i>

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.990
Are definitely one and the same

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.990
きっとそれはひとつだよと

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:08.240
<i>Kaze ga hoho wo naderu</i>

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:08.240
So the wind tells me as it caresses my cheeks

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:08.240
風が頬をなでる

01:46:18.480 --> 01:46:25.230
Madamada yume wa samenai ne

01:46:18.480 --> 01:46:25.230
まだまだ夢は醒めないね

01:46:18.480 --> 01:46:25.230
We won't be waking from our dream for a while still

01:46:25.230 --> 01:46:31.870
Kono michi no mukou nani ga matterun darou

01:46:25.230 --> 01:46:31.870
この道の向こう何が待ってるんだろう?

01:46:25.230 --> 01:46:31.870
What do you think lies at the end of this path?

01:46:31.870 --> 01:46:38.420
Kitto kitto kotae wa aru kara

01:46:31.870 --> 01:46:38.420
きっときっと答えはあるから

01:46:31.870 --> 01:50:07.280
m 0 984 l 1920 984 1920 1080 0 1080

01:46:31.870 --> 01:46:38.420
Because I'm sure there's an answer

01:46:38.420 --> 01:46:45.040
Akiramekirenai tachidomarenain da

01:46:38.420 --> 01:46:45.040
諦めきれない立ち止まれないんだ

01:46:38.420 --> 01:46:45.040
I can't give up on it, I can't stop in my tracks

01:46:45.040 --> 01:46:48.340
Demo ushirogami hiku

01:46:45.040 --> 01:46:48.340
でも後ろ髪引く

01:46:45.040 --> 01:46:48.340
But something's pulling me back

01:46:48.340 --> 01:46:51.580
Ato sukoshi dake demo

01:46:48.340 --> 01:46:51.580
あと少しだけでも

01:46:48.340 --> 01:46:51.580
Even if it's for just a little longer

01:46:51.580 --> 01:47:01.690
Sono yawaraka na egao no tonari ni itai keredo

01:46:51.580 --> 01:47:01.690
その柔らかな 笑顔の隣に居たいけれど

01:46:51.580 --> 01:47:01.690
I want to stay beside you as you smile softly

01:47:02.200 --> 01:47:09.060
Massugu ni kakedasu harewataru aozora ga mabushii

01:47:02.200 --> 01:47:09.060
真っ直ぐに駆け出す 晴れ渡る青空が眩しい

01:47:02.200 --> 01:47:09.060
I start running straight ahead under a clear and dazzling blue sky

01:47:09.060 --> 01:47:15.660
Oikaze ni aorare atarashii tabi ga hajimaru

01:47:09.060 --> 01:47:15.660
追い風に煽られ 新しい旅が始まる

01:47:09.060 --> 01:47:15.660
The wind on my back pushes me on as I begin a new journey

01:47:15.660 --> 01:47:22.190
Itsuka mata aeru you furikaerazu ni asu e mukau yo

01:47:15.660 --> 01:47:22.190
いつかまた会えるよう 振り返らずに明日へ向かうよ

01:47:15.660 --> 01:47:22.190
So that we can meet again one day, I face the future without looking back

01:47:22.190 --> 01:47:28.000
Good luck my way shinjiru michi e

01:47:22.190 --> 01:47:28.000
Good luck my way 信じる道へ

01:47:22.190 --> 01:47:28.000
Good luck my way, on the path I believe in

01:47:29.170 --> 01:47:35.990
Acchikocchi kakezurimawatte

01:47:29.170 --> 01:47:35.990
あっちこっち駆けずり回って

01:47:29.170 --> 01:47:35.990
It doesn't look like I'll get an answer

01:47:35.990 --> 01:47:42.520
Tatakikomanai to kotae wa denai mitai

01:47:35.990 --> 01:47:42.520
叩き込まないと答えは出ないみたい

01:47:35.990 --> 01:47:42.520
If I don't run around everywhere and keep on trying

01:47:42.520 --> 01:47:49.120
Kitto kitto koukai shinaide

01:47:42.520 --> 01:47:49.120
きっときっと後悔しないで

01:47:42.520 --> 01:47:49.120
I will never, ever have regrets

01:47:49.120 --> 01:47:55.550
Waraiaeru you susumitsuzukerun da

01:47:49.120 --> 01:47:55.550
